---
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Join"
  description="Understand the D10YLC joining process and which eligibility and commitment details are awaiting approval."
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Join D10YLC"
    title="Your next step starts here."
    intro="If you care about your community and want to practice civic leadership with other young people, D10YLC may be a place to contribute and grow."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <div class="notice">
        <strong>The official application is not yet published</strong>
        Current eligibility, commitment, consent, review, privacy, and response
        details are being approved. This page will link to one
        organization-owned form when those decisions are complete.
      </div>

      <h2>What you can expect to work on</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Learning how local government and community decision-making work.</li>
        <li>Listening to peers and communicating youth perspectives.</li>
        <li>Planning service, policy, event, or workshop activities with a team.</li>
        <li>Building practical skills in collaboration and public leadership.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The planned joining path</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Check the approved criteria</strong>
            Confirm grade, geography or school, term, attendance, and time
            expectations before sharing personal information.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Complete one official form</strong>
            The form will explain what is collected, who receives it, why it is
            needed, and any parent or guardian consent.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Receive a clear response</strong>
            The published process will state whether applications are reviewed,
            expected response timing, and what onboarding involves.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Before the form goes live</h2>
      <p>
        Do not send personal or student information to addresses found on older
        pages. The designated organization contact and data owner are being
        confirmed. You can still explore <a href="/about/">what D10YLC does</a>
        and check for <a href="/events/">verified opportunities</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
